I am Simon the Pharisee. I return from the synagogue and for some this town calls it conversation.
For those who respect the Law, this matter is not as straightforward as the crowds claim.
A man heals on the Sabbath and claims authority over the Law. Torah asks the question. The crowd needs an answer.
